      {
        "title": "Mystic Cave Zone",
        "text": "Mystic Cave Zone is the sixth level of Sonic the Hedgehog 2 (Sega, 1992), a dark cave. VGMPF lists its tune at two minutes."
      },
      {
        "title": "Eerie wails",
        "text": "In the Sonic Stadium Soundtrack Squad Review (2010), the reviewer BlitzChris wrote of \"the eerie wails of the dark Mystic Cave\". Another reviewer, T-BIRD, named this tune his favorite on the Genesis version and praised its slap bass."
      }
